1519591825,49521,Noise,1.489969917735888e-14,1018,Noise,4271,non-3-OH,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of continuous, high-amplitude instrumental noise fluctuating around 0.8 log amplitude across the full 0 to 6.4 s range, with only a random noise spike reaching 1.0 at ~1.99 s. It completely lacks a coherent Na+ peak (expected between 1.4 and 2.0 s) and the required Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak ~1.49 s later.",
