1519592891,50323,Noise,1.227559957709453e-14,1018,Noise,4638,non-3-OH,non-3-OH,"The spectrum consists entirely of instrumental noise with a single sharp spike at ~0.14 5s, completely lacking a dominant Na+ peak between 1.4 and 2.0 5s and any subsequent Na(NaOH)+ cluster peak.",
